# INVWINZ.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the item keys by
# level.  At level 1 CTRL-E, INS and DEL show INV's refusal in a message box
# and ENTER still shows the item in view mode; after File > Log out,
# at level 2 CTRL-E edits; the end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINZ.SNP is
# its snapshot.
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER
K CTRL-E
S NOEDIT
K ENTER INS
S NOINS
K ENTER DEL
S NODEL
K ENTER
S BACK
K ENTER
S VIEW
K ESC ALT-F L
K STAB
T CLERK
K TAB
T Clerk1986
K ENTER CTRL-E
S EDIT
K ESC ALT-F X
